# Effect Days 2024: The origin story

Michael traces Effect to a fintech system that needed reliable tests, manageable dependencies, controlled concurrency, resource safety, and retries. [02:29](https://youtu.be/7sJc3Z4mh1w?t=149) [08:40](https://youtu.be/7sJc3Z4mh1w?t=520)

He says dependency injection was the missing testing seam, then describes moving through ZIO ports, a TypeScript fork, a rewrite for approachability, and a merger with fp-ts. [03:49](https://youtu.be/7sJc3Z4mh1w?t=229) [15:02](https://youtu.be/7sJc3Z4mh1w?t=902) [21:04](https://youtu.be/7sJc3Z4mh1w?t=1264)
